{
  "$schema": "iswc-preview/v1",
  "tag": "iswc-state-diagram",
  "category": "diagrams",
  "title": "&lt;iswc-state-diagram&gt;",
  "titleHtml": false,
  "storageKey": "docs-iswc-state-diagram",
  "sections": [
    {
      "id": "intro",
      "title": "Uso",
      "lede": [
        "Diagrama de estados en SVG, sin Mermaid. Tú declaras estados y",
        "          transiciones; el componente decide las capas, reduce los cruces y",
        "          rutea las flechas rodeando los estados."
      ],
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "html",
          "html": [
            "<p>",
            "          Comparte motor con <code>&lt;iswc-flowchart&gt;</code>: mismo esquema",
            "          JSON, mismo visor a pantalla completa y la misma animación tortuga,",
            "          que aquí recorre las transiciones en orden.",
            "        </p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "demo",
          "html": [
            "<iswc-state-diagram open-on-click>",
            "            <script type=\"application/json\">",
            "              {",
            "                \"stateDiagram\": {",
            "                  \"title\": \"Ciclo de vida de la factura\",",
            "                  \"direction\": \"TB\",",
            "                  \"groups\": [",
            "                    { \"id\": \"g-flujo\", \"name\": \"Flujo\", \"hue\": 239 },",
            "                    { \"id\": \"g-cierre\", \"name\": \"Cierre\", \"hue\": 38 }",
            "                  ],",
            "                  \"states\": [",
            "                    { \"id\": \"inicio\", \"kind\": \"start\", \"group\": \"g-flujo\" },",
            "                    { \"id\": \"borrador\", \"label\": \"Borrador\", \"group\": \"g-flujo\",",
            "                      \"desc\": \"Editable por el usuario; sin CUFE asignado.\" },",
            "                    { \"id\": \"decision\", \"label\": \"¿Datos válidos?\", \"kind\": \"choice\", \"group\": \"g-flujo\" },",
            "                    { \"id\": \"emitida\", \"label\": \"Emitida\", \"group\": \"g-cierre\",",
            "                      \"desc\": \"Enviada y aceptada por la **DIAN**.\" },",
            "                    { \"id\": \"anulada\", \"label\": \"Anulada\", \"group\": \"g-cierre\" },",
            "                    { \"id\": \"fin\", \"kind\": \"end\", \"group\": \"g-cierre\" }",
            "                  ],",
            "                  \"transitions\": [",
            "                    { \"from\": \"inicio\", \"to\": \"borrador\" },",
            "                    { \"from\": \"borrador\", \"to\": \"decision\", \"label\": \"validar\" },",
            "                    { \"from\": \"decision\", \"to\": \"borrador\", \"label\": \"no\" },",
            "                    { \"from\": \"decision\", \"to\": \"emitida\", \"label\": \"sí\" },",
            "                    { \"from\": \"emitida\", \"to\": \"anulada\", \"label\": \"anular\" },",
            "                    { \"from\": \"anulada\", \"to\": \"fin\" },",
            "                    { \"from\": \"emitida\", \"to\": \"fin\" }",
            "                  ]",
            "                }",
            "              }",
            "            </script>",
            "          </iswc-state-diagram>"
          ],
          "controls": [
            {
              "control": "boolean",
              "prop": "attr:open-on-click",
              "label": "open-on-click"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "tipos",
      "title": "Tipos de estado",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "html",
          "html": [
            "<p>",
            "          <code>kind</code> acepta <code>start</code> (círculo negro relleno),",
            "          <code>end</code> (círculo relleno dentro de un anillo),",
            "          <code>normal</code> (rectángulo redondeado, por defecto) y",
            "          <code>choice</code> (rombo de decisión).",
            "        </p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "demo",
          "html": [
            "<iswc-state-diagram open-on-click>",
            "            <script type=\"application/json\">",
            "              {",
            "                \"stateDiagram\": {",
            "                  \"direction\": \"LR\",",
            "                  \"states\": [",
            "                    { \"id\": \"a\", \"kind\": \"start\" },",
            "                    { \"id\": \"b\", \"label\": \"Procesando\" },",
            "                    { \"id\": \"c\", \"label\": \"¿Ok?\", \"kind\": \"choice\" },",
            "                    { \"id\": \"d\", \"label\": \"Rechazado\" },",
            "                    { \"id\": \"e\", \"kind\": \"end\" }",
            "                  ],",
            "                  \"transitions\": [",
            "                    { \"from\": \"a\", \"to\": \"b\" },",
            "                    { \"from\": \"b\", \"to\": \"c\" },",
            "                    { \"from\": \"c\", \"to\": \"d\", \"label\": \"no\" },",
            "                    { \"from\": \"c\", \"to\": \"e\", \"label\": \"sí\" }",
            "                  ]",
            "                }",
            "              }",
            "            </script>",
            "          </iswc-state-diagram>"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ciclos",
      "title": "Ciclos y auto-transiciones",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "html",
          "html": [
            "<p>",
            "          El motor detecta las transiciones que vuelven atrás y las rutea por",
            "          un lado, en vez de colgarse intentando ordenar un grafo cíclico. Una",
            "          transición de un estado a sí mismo también se dibuja sin romper el",
            "          layout.",
            "        </p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "demo",
          "html": [
            "<iswc-state-diagram open-on-click>",
            "            <script type=\"application/json\">",
            "              {",
            "                \"stateDiagram\": {",
            "                  \"direction\": \"TB\",",
            "                  \"states\": [",
            "                    { \"id\": \"s1\", \"kind\": \"start\" },",
            "                    { \"id\": \"s2\", \"label\": \"Revisión\" },",
            "                    { \"id\": \"s3\", \"label\": \"Aprobación\" },",
            "                    { \"id\": \"s4\", \"kind\": \"end\" }",
            "                  ],",
            "                  \"transitions\": [",
            "                    { \"from\": \"s1\", \"to\": \"s2\" },",
            "                    { \"from\": \"s2\", \"to\": \"s3\", \"label\": \"enviar\" },",
            "                    { \"from\": \"s3\", \"to\": \"s2\", \"label\": \"rechazar\" },",
            "                    { \"from\": \"s2\", \"to\": \"s2\", \"label\": \"reintento\" },",
            "                    { \"from\": \"s3\", \"to\": \"s4\", \"label\": \"aprobar\" }",
            "                  ]",
            "                }",
            "              }",
            "            </script>",
            "          </iswc-state-diagram>"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "api",
      "title": "Referencia",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "html",
          "html": "<h3>Atributos</h3>"
        },
        {
          "kind": "table",
          "columns": [
            "Nombre",
            "Valores",
            "Descripción"
          ],
          "rows": [
            [
              "<code>variant</code>",
              "<code>inline</code> · <code>viewer</code>",
              "inline abre el visor al hacer clic; viewer activa hover, tooltips, leyenda clickeable y auto-animación."
            ],
            [
              "<code>open-on-click</code>",
              "booleano",
              "Habilita abrir el visor a pantalla completa al hacer clic. Por defecto el componente no tiene visor."
            ]
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "html",
          "html": "<h3>Esquema del JSON</h3>"
        },
        {
          "kind": "table",
          "columns": [
            "Campo",
            "Descripción"
          ],
          "rows": [
            [
              "<code>direction</code>",
              "<code>TB</code> · <code>BT</code> · <code>LR</code> · <code>RL</code>."
            ],
            [
              "<code>states[].id</code>",
              "Identificador que referencian las transiciones."
            ],
            [
              "<code>states[].label</code>",
              "Texto del estado. Admite markdown inline."
            ],
            [
              "<code>states[].kind</code>",
              "<code>normal</code> (default) · <code>start</code> · <code>end</code> · <code>choice</code>."
            ],
            [
              "<code>states[].group</code>",
              "Id del grupo; define el color del estado."
            ],
            [
              "<code>states[].desc</code>",
              "Descripción extendida para el tooltip del visor."
            ],
            [
              "<code>transitions[].from</code> · <code>to</code>",
              "Ids de estado. Una transición a un id inexistente se descarta."
            ],
            [
              "<code>transitions[].label</code>",
              "Rótulo sobre la flecha."
            ],
            [
              "<code>groups[].hue</code>",
              "Tono HSL 0–360."
            ]
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "html",
          "html": "<h3>Propiedades y eventos</h3>"
        },
        {
          "kind": "table",
          "columns": [
            "Nombre",
            "Descripción"
          ],
          "rows": [
            [
              "<code>payload</code>",
              "Configuración JSON; alternativa al script hijo."
            ],
            [
              "<code>layout</code>",
              "Geometría calculada (solo lectura)."
            ],
            [
              "<code>turtle</code>",
              "API de la animación: play / pause / stop / next / prev."
            ],
            [
              "<code>hiddenGroups</code>",
              "Set de grupos ocultos; al cambiar, el diagrama se re-diseña sin esos estados."
            ],
            [
              "<code>iswc-render</code>",
              "Evento: el SVG terminó de construirse."
            ],
            [
              "<code>iswc-turtle-state</code>",
              "Evento: estado de la animación."
            ]
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "app-api",
      "title": "App API",
      "lede": "El mismo documento se abre en el visor o en el editor. El parámetro json no se reescribe al modificar el diagrama.",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "html",
          "html": "<p><a href=\"demos/diagramas/app/view.html?kind=state\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Abrir visor</a> · <a href=\"demos/diagramas/app/edit.html?kind=state\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Abrir editor</a></p>"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "ficha": {
    "sections": {
      "anatomia": {
        "content": [
          "Diagrama de estados en SVG, sin Mermaid. Tú declaras estados y",
          "          transiciones; el componente decide las capas, reduce los cruces y",
          "          rutea las flechas rodeando los estados."
        ]
      },
      "ejemplos": {
        "content": [
          "```html",
          "<iswc-state-diagram open-on-click>",
          "            <script type=\"application/json\">",
          "              {",
          "                \"stateDiagram\": {",
          "                  \"title\": \"Ciclo de vida de la factura\",",
          "                  \"direction\": \"TB\",",
          "                  \"groups\": [",
          "                    { \"id\": \"g-flujo\", \"name\": \"Flujo\", \"hue\": 239 },",
          "                    { \"id\": \"g-cierre\", \"name\": \"Cierre\", \"hue\": 38 }",
          "                  ],",
          "                  \"states\": [",
          "                    { \"id\": \"inicio\", \"kind\": \"start\", \"group\": \"g-flujo\" },",
          "                    { \"id\": \"borrador\", \"label\": \"Borrador\", \"group\": \"g-flujo\",",
          "                      \"desc\": \"Editable por el usuario; sin CUFE asignado.\" },",
          "                    { \"id\": \"decision\", \"label\": \"¿Datos válidos?\", \"kind\": \"choice\", \"group\": \"g-flujo\" },",
          "                    { \"id\": \"emitida\", \"label\": \"Emitida\", \"group\": \"g-cierre\",",
          "                      \"desc\": \"Enviada y aceptada por la **DIAN**.\" },",
          "                    { \"id\": \"anulada\", \"label\": \"Anulada\", \"group\": \"g-cierre\" },",
          "                    { \"id\": \"fin\", \"kind\": \"end\", \"group\": \"g-cierre\" }",
          "                  ],",
          "                  \"transitions\": [",
          "                    { \"from\": \"inicio\", \"to\": \"borrador\" },",
          "                    { \"from\": \"borrador\", \"to\": \"decision\", \"label\": \"validar\" },",
          "                    { \"from\": \"decision\", \"to\": \"borrador\", \"label\": \"no\" },",
          "                    { \"from\": \"decision\", \"to\": \"emitida\", \"label\": \"sí\" },",
          "                    { \"from\": \"emitida\", \"to\": \"anulada\", \"label\": \"anular\" },",
          "                    { \"from\": \"anulada\", \"to\": \"fin\" },",
          "                    { \"from\": \"emitida\", \"to\": \"fin\" }",
          "                  ]",
          "                }",
          "              }",
          "            </script>",
          "          </iswc-state-diagram>",
          "```"
        ]
      }
    },
    "exclude": [
      "apiJs",
      "atributos",
      "eventos",
      "parts",
      "props",
      "slots",
      "states"
    ]
  }
}
